// Bit-vector and Boolean normalization rules (include/sea/Expr/BvRules.hh):
// one case per rule, each checked for soundness with Yices (`in = out`
// valid with no assumption), and a seeded random test (sound, a normal form,
// the same result in two fresh factories). The views group checks that the
// Lean formalization's zext / sext / shl views equal Expr's operators (z3 and
// Yices validity).
RUN: sea-bv-rules-test 300 | FileCheck %s
REQUIRES: yices
CHECK: test: extract ok
CHECK: test: concat ok
CHECK: test: ac ok
CHECK: test: eq ok
CHECK: test: ite ok
CHECK: test: guards ok
CHECK: views: queries=
CHECK: test: views ok
CHECK: random: terms=300
CHECK: random-mem: terms=150
CHECK: failures: 0

